 begin="3:32.573" end="3:33.066">ro</span><span begin="3:33.066" end="3:33.532">un</span> <span begin="3:33.532" end="3:33.832">dal</span><span begin="3:33.832" end="3:34.071">bi</span><span begin="3:34.071" end="3:35.222">che</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="3:35.648" end="3:35.988">dal</span><span begin="3:35.988" end="3:36.188">bi</span><span begin="3:36.188" end="3:37.198">che</span> <span begin="3:38.268" end="3:38.848">deo</span> <span begin="3:38.848" end="3:39.168">dal</span><span begin="3:39.168" end="3:39.348">bi</span><span begin="3:39.348" end="3:40.088">che</span> <span begin="3:41.438" end="3:41.967">deo</span> <span begin="3:41.967" end="3:42.337">dal</span><span begin="3:42.337" end="3:42.494">bi</span><span begin="3:42.494" end="3:43.073">che</span> <span begin="3:43.073" end="3:43.560">deo</span> <span begin="3:43.560" end="3:43.908">dal</span><span begin="3:43.908" end="3:44.088">bi</span><span begin="3:44.088" end="3:44.654">che</span> <span begin="3:44.654" end="3:45.137">deo</span> <span begin="3:45.137" end="3:45.667">deo</span> <span begin="3:45.667" end="3:46.211">deo</span> <span begin="3:46.211" end="3:46.538">deo</span> <span begin="3:46.538" end="3:46.734">deo</span> <span begin="3:46.734" end="3:47.228">dal</span><span begin="3:47.228" end="3:47.648">bi</span><span begin="3:47.648" end="3:48.330">che</span></text><text for="L34"><span begin="3:48.294" end="3:49.706">Ooh</span> <span begin="3:49.706" end="3:50.782">yea</span> <span begin="3:51.341" end="3:51.977">yeah</span> <span begin="3:51.977" end="3:52.524">yeah</span> <span begin="3:52.524" end="3:52.883">yeah</span> <span begin="3:52.883" end="3:53.062">yeah</span> <span begin="3:53.062" end="3:53.657">yeah</span></text><text for="L35"><span begin="3:54.101" end="3:54.457">dal</span><span begin="3:54.457" end="3:54.640">bi</span><span begin="3:54.640" end="3:55.143">che</span> <span begin="3:55.143" end="3:55.561">bi</span><span begin="3:55.561" end="3:56.211">chin</span> <span begin="3:56.211" end="3:56.741">yu</span><span begin="3:56.741" end="3:57.151">ri</span><span begin="3:57.151" end="3:57.791">chang</span><span begin="3:57.791" end="3:59.121">do</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">纵使月光映照的玻璃窗</text><text for="L2">亦不曾这般闪烁 你那泪光盈盈的眼眸</text><text for="L3">漆黑夜空中近乎刺痛般</text><text for="L4">曾绽放殷切微光的星辉 与曾相伴迎来的晨曦</text><text for="L5">纵然将你拥入怀中 你却不在此间</text><text for="L6">唯余熏黑烟痕与燃尽的灰烬</text><text for="L7">无论怎样的结局又何妨 Yeah</text><text for="L8">我愿许你予我伤痕</text><text for="L9">请让我再一次押注于爱</text><text for="L10">纵然我早已无可救药</text><text for="L11">却仍任性地渴求着你</text><text for="L12">这本就由不得我抉择</text><text for="L13">纵使我早已坠入爱河</text><text for="L14">任凭多么带刺的言语</text><text for="L15">亦不及那般锋利 你的沉默 空洞的双眸</text><text for="L16">宛如干涸枯槁的枝桠</text><text for="L17">紧拥这般的你伫立原地 纵然泪水倾泻而出</text><text for="L18">你却似挣脱般将我推开 令我无从靠近你</text><text for="L19">我偏又翻涌着愈发盈满 几欲向你漫溢倾泻</text><text for="L20">啊啊 不负责任的你 每日都在改换面容</text><text for="L21">请不要从我身边逃离</text><text for="L22">我的世界因你而立 亦因你而崩塌</text><text for="L23">你却一直在佯装不知</text><text for="L24">任凭怎样的结局又何妨 Yeah</text><text for="L25">我愿许你予我伤痕</text><text for="L26">请让我再一次押注于爱</text><text for="L27">纵然我早已无可救药</text><text for="L28">却仍任性地渴求着你</text><text for="L29">这本就由不得我抉择</text><text for="L30">纵使我早已沦陷于爱</text><text for="L31">我却只是日渐消瘦 愈发深陷</text><text for="L32">在这锋利的月光下</text><text for="L33">在月光下更甚 在月光里愈深 于月色中愈浓 愈重 愈烈 愈沉 尽在这月光里</text><text for="L34">Ooh yea yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah</text><text for="L35">就连月光映照的玻璃窗也</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:59.121"><div begin="0:00.300" end="3:59.121"><p begin="0:00.300" end="0:05.160" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.300" end="0:00.630">달</span><span begin="0:00.630" end="0:00.830">빛</span><span begin="0:00.830" end="0:01.360">에</span> <span begin="0:01.360" end="0:01.860">비</span><span begin="0:01